# teru-test - sandbox desk for the terumon-dev track's 4 seeded terumon
# (terumon_001_ember, terumon_002_glacine, terumon_003_murmur,
# terumon_004_solvent). Each is a pixelated round entity of its own
# color, cropped from #.NNEST_ASSETS/tearit-co/terumon/
# 10.TERU_ROYGBIVBWB_charas.PNG and converted via tp_asset_to_sprite.+x
# (the same real image-to-sprite pipeline used earlier for arbitrary
# non-emoji images). No building/structure sprite - the round sprite IS
# the whole identity, unlike dsr-dev's castles/banks/stores. Simple 2x2
# grid layout, GRID_CELL_PX=80 spacing, mirrors dsr-dev.pdl's row format.
